The 2D online co-op game "Cat Gladiator", developed by a three-person team, will launch a demo version in late April. Welcome to add it to your wishlist and join the experience!

This demo version includes:

Team up with friends or online players to battle bosses;

Experience 6 weapons: Sword&Shield, LongSword, SmallCannon, GreatSword, DualBlades, Harp;

Three types of boss hunting challenges;

Exclusive Cat equipment, items, weapons, etc.

If you're interested in "Cat Gladiators", please add to wishlist and join [url=https://discord.gg/3bhxsGMK]Discord[/url]. Let's share hunting strategies in the arena!
